sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as FeastOperator Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Reconciler as ODH Reconciler<br/>Action Pipeline
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Action<br/>Manifest Rendering
    participant Deploy as Deploy Action<br/>Ordered Apply + Cache
    participant GC as GC Action<br/>Garbage Collection
    participant Cluster as Cluster Resources<br/>Deployments, Services, RBAC
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Scrapes Metrics

    Note over User,Cluster: Reconciliation Trigger Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update FeastOperator CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: FeastOperator changed
    Controller->>Controller: Check finalizer<br/>Add if missing

    Note over Controller,Cluster: Action Pipeline Execution

    Controller->>Reconciler: Execute reconciliation pipeline
    Reconciler->>Kustomize: Render manifests from /manifests/
    Kustomize-->>Reconciler: Rendered resources<br/>(with labels applied)
    Reconciler->>Deploy: Apply resources (ordered, cached)
    Deploy->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments<br/>ServiceAccount TLS
    Deploy->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Services
    Deploy->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMaps
    Deploy->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ClusterRoles<br/>ClusterRoleBindings
    Deploy->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitors
    Deploy->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Jobs
    K8sAPI-->>Deploy: Resource status
    Reconciler->>GC: Garbage collect stale resources
    GC->>K8sAPI: Delete orphaned resources
    Reconciler-->>Controller: Pipeline complete

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator/status<br/>Deployment availability

    Note over Controller,Prometheus: Monitoring Flow

    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>8443/HTTPS<br/>RBAC Auth (TokenReview)
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Metrics response

    Note over Controller,Cluster: Additional Watch Triggers

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch: CRD changes<br/>(component label filter)
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch: Platform ConfigMap changes
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch: Feast FeatureStore CR events
    Controller->>Reconciler: Re-execute pipeline

    Note over Controller,Cluster: Cleanup Flow (Deletion)

    User->>K8sAPI: Delete FeastOperator CR
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event: FeastOperator deleted
    Controller->>Controller: Finalizer cleanup
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Delete ClusterRoles<br/>(no owner refs for cluster-scoped)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Delete ClusterRoleBindings
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Remove finalizer
